14.5 TL
1 0 0 1 72 690 Tm
(The periods below are measured from the date the record was created, except for) Tj
T*
(employee records, which are measured from the termination date. Every period is a) Tj
T*
(maximum and every class is purged by the monthly job described on page 3.) Tj
