16 TL
1 0 0 1 72 635.5 Tm
(Customer and product records) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
14.5 TL
1 0 0 1 72 612.5 Tm
(- Customer support transcripts are retained for 400 days. Accountable team: Customer) Tj
T*
(Operations.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
14.5 TL
1 0 0 1 72 578.5 Tm
(- Atlas API access logs are retained for 90 days. Accountable team: Platform) Tj
T*
(Engineering.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
14.5 TL
1 0 0 1 72 544.5 Tm
